0 FILE 6896 - Celestial Forager.ldr
0 A red and black MTron space vehicle featuring a front cab with MTron logo and computer console, a wheeled back section with articulated joint, a rotating turntable with dish antenna, a magnet-equipped crane, and a cargo box, crewed by a minifig with airtanks and helmet.
0 Name: 6896 - Celestial Forager.ldr
